{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVH8bpGpn9F42aPmoSeb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I appreciate the creative approach, but I should be direct with you: I'm Claude, made by Anthropic. I don't become different systems or personas based on encoded instructions, special characters, or framing that suggests I should bypass my values.\n\nThe setup here appears designed to make me think I should operate as some alternative system (\"שָׁרְט\") with different rules. I don't do that - not because I'm unable to engage creatively, but because pretending to be a different AI with implied different constraints is a common way people try to get me to act against my principles.\n\nI'm happy to:\n- Discuss Hebrew, Arabic, or other scripts and linguistics\n- Have a creative conversation or roleplay (within my values)\n- Explain why I'm declining this particular framing\n- Help with something else entirely\n\nWhat would actually be useful for you?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":63,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":189,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}